  description: 'A radiant, many-pointed star-flower that seems to hold a faint light
    of its own even deep in shade, its petals glow with the lights of a thousand
    stars.


    Said to hold something of the night''s own heart at its centre,
    a sliver of captured moonlight that never quite goes out.'
  descriptionSecondary: Harvesting it yields a Heart item, carried to the World Tree
    and consumed there to reveal one of its three hidden crystal layers.
